  "summary": "NTN Bearing Corp. of America, a bearing manufacturer in Schaumburg, Illinois, was hit by the Payouts King ransomware group on April 15, 2026. The group claimed 596 GB of data, including employees' personal information, Social Security numbers, dates of birth, addresses, government IDs, medical and financial records and business and engineering files, posting the claim on May 13 with a five-to-six-day publication threat. It reported to the Indiana Attorney General on June 22, 2026.",
